{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1340.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"4263008dacaf259d5df00eb4cc320f4cd9a0545bb524e81801f11916912538e8","ja":"カリスマギャルじゃなくて","zh":"不是魅力四射的辣妹，而是","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1340.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"8ee15de116a60f2da51d146998df1c7264dd08bd33473ec335bcbe9ce24f4f3f","ja":"このままだと、ず～っともやしが買えなくて、\nもやし料理が作れなくなっちゃうかも……。","zh":"要是这样下去，说不定会一直买不到豆芽，\n做不了豆芽菜了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1340.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d0079c52db4a6cbde0c1e4fc2bffbd54db24bf4fb8e0c69ad572b02d24afcf7f","ja":"でも、流行はしばらく……\n続いちゃう、かも……。","zh":"不过，这股流行或许……\n还会持续一段时间……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1340.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"6d3f5efe971f2d00a1295eeb33defd0271823bd3e9f15c888fc00221e84ff974","ja":"なら別の食材をすすめて、そっちをマネして\nもらう、ってのは……いや、これはナシだな。","zh":"那推荐别的食材，让她去模仿那个\n……不对，这个行不通啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1340.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"8b16b29273b51d5331a6c45083ffffa5c7f808cb2a0c9c48497ec7d95622e15f","ja":"ウチらのことマネしたいって思っている人たちに\nウソをつくことになっちまうからな……。","zh":"那样就等于对想要模仿我们的人\n撒谎了啊……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1340.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"d9c59d20f61181636753d4c17df3f2aa8d224358ec46902e764a49552bfc10de","ja":"それなら……同じ料理でも使う材料を変える……\nっていうのは、どう……？","zh":"要是那样的话……同样的菜肴换用别的食材……\n你觉得这样，怎么样……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1340.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"a4c9b8d7d4d88fb4b4acec2d843ed36792378293e493c070807ab65c10badd49","ja":"もやしの代わりに、\n豆苗とかキャベツで作るとか？","zh":"用豆苗或包菜\n代替豆芽来做呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1340.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"04f0ef45c1a0045a46466ee20b06bb7bec9c149c5c3986facade60d2ef5e75a1","ja":"もやしよりちょっと高いけど……。あ、でも、\nそれが良かったらみんなにおススメできるかも！","zh":"虽然比豆芽菜稍微贵了点……。啊，不过，\n要是那个不错的话，说不定可以推荐给大家！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1340.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"8cabaaff03d8063584d7eb2576cf7aa700d2328a4920b076c5327c0f75f0054f","ja":"なるほど！　自分でいろいろ試して\n良いのを紹介するなら、ウソじゃないしな！","zh":"原来如此！　自己去尝试各种各样的事物，\n然后介绍觉得好的，那就不是撒谎了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1340.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"e0ab252d7a2a7759640a45f718b1daee66f98ea696d1dbc63ec05799f6a28cad","ja":"それなら……売り切れもなくなって……たくさんの\n人がいろんな料理に……挑戦できそう……。","zh":"这样的话……就不会售罄了……\n也能让很多人……尝试各种料理了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1340.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"e6989953b623545f1d6e412af8e1b298ee3fdaf2fe488c07e5b1c20f5b715366","ja":"うっうー！　私、それならできそうです！\nいろんなお野菜で試してみようかなーって！","zh":"呜呜—！如果是那个的话，我好像能做到！\n我在想，要不要用各种各样的蔬菜试一试呢～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1340.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"d94fab09b7c6133a2414fdf815ee2346304876a7585a6d884be864b1eb17a8af","ja":"えへへ……やよいちゃん、カリスマギャルじゃ\nなくて……お料理研究家みたい……だね。","zh":"嘿嘿……弥生，看起来不像\n时尚辣妹……倒像是个美食家……呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1340.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"fb62a56c777f1f9d3680a19eb83d7e0172eb169fa514d1a3d2bb724394d76261","ja":"そうなのかな？　よくわかんないけど……。","zh":"是这样吗？虽然我不太懂就是了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1340.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"4820289b35dc703c23e92ffecf713234821b22767be7ade751487dc32cf6afc6","ja":"みんなに喜んでもらえるなら、私、\nカリスマギャルでもお料理研究家でもいいかなーって♪","zh":"只要能让大家开心，我觉得自己\n当领军辣妹还是料理研究家都挺好的～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
